<p>Here is my Python (based on <a href="https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/convert-xml-to-csv-in-python/" rel="nofollow noreferrer">https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/convert-xml-to-csv-in-python/</a>):</p>
<pre class="lang-py prettyprint-override"><code># -*- coding: utf-8 -*-

